      "message": "test(app): pin the gouge refusal of each tilted operation kind\n\nEach kind that accepts a tilt (Face, Contour, Pocket, 2D Adaptive,\n2D Offset, Engrave, Trace, 2D Chamfer, Circular) gets a probe that cuts\ninto a correct box part at A 90 and A -90 (and upright, except the slow\nadaptive). The test asserts the blocking verdict at generation, the\nrefused post and no file written. All kinds are refused; Slot keeps its\npins in tilted_gouge.rs.\n\nFixes #2720\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
